(
    title: "Elf Adventure",
    developer: Some("Warren Robinett"),
    description: Some("Warren Robinett\'s abandoned sequel to Adventure, three months in when the crash killed it: six looping rooms, item-collecting, and its one genuinely new idea — elves with simulated moods, who warm to gifts, rage at theft, and hurl axes when angry. You can throw axes back, the intended seven-jewel quest was never implemented, and the surviving builds are playable but rough — this entry holds three dated EPROMs from April and May 1983."),
